div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br>\r\n</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">ggplot() + geom_line(aes(x = variable, y = value, group = id), </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">                     data = mtcarsm[mtcarsm$id %in% unique(mtcarsm$id)[1:4],]) + </font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           coord_radar() + </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           facet_wrap(~id, ncol = 2)</font></div></div><div><br></div><div>which provides</div><div>\r\n<br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-myEaiFte8qM/Um8jlfHYbxI/AAAAAAAAdZw/QWL_80_Gws8/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-myEaiFte8qM/Um8jlfHYbxI/AAAAAAAAdZw/QWL_80_Gws8/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371852397000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DysOvVEkZh56NGYUuS1Pv\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-myEaiFte8qM/Um8jlfHYbxI/AAAAAAAAdZw/QWL_80_Gws8/s1600/Rplot.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">How do I complete the star diagram?</p><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
