rs)</font></div>\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">mtcars[, c(1:5)] &lt;- llply(mtcars[, c(1:5)], function(i) scale(i))</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br>\n</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">mtcarsm &lt;- melt(mtcars[, c(1:5, ncol(mtcars))], id.vars  = &quot;id&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br>\n</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">ggplot() + geom_line(aes(x = variable, y = value, group = id), </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">                     data = mtcarsm[mtcarsm$id %in% unique(mtcarsm$id)[1:4],]) + </font></div>\n<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           coord_radar() + </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           facet_wrap(~id, ncol = 2)</font></div></div><div><br></div><div>which provides</div><div>\n<br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-myEaiFte8qM/Um8jlfHYbxI/AAAAAAAAdZw/QWL_80_Gws8/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-myEaiFte8qM/Um8jlfHYbxI/AAAAAAAAdZw/QWL_80_Gws8/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371852398000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0CfYqk1d2wekz6_WYdJ46I\"><img border=\"0\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">How do I complete the star diagram?</p><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\n\n<p></p>\n\n-- <br>\n-- <br>\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirect